      "id": "a749737d-9dff-4912-b2df-7e7ef0c90e2a",
      "content": "The project uses Awilix as the DI container library because it's decorator-free, CommonJS-native, and lightweight (~15KB). This choice avoids decorator dependencies and works well with the existing CommonJS setup.",
